1 2 [c] The iTrust2 user has authenticated themselves in iTrust2 . An HCP is a registered user of the iTrust2 Medical Records system . The HCP has authenticated themselves in the iTrust2 Medical Records system . The HCP has started documenting an office visit, including basic health metrics, for the patient [UC7 & UC8].
2 3 [s] hcp The HCP selects the correct diagnosis from the menu of diagnoses options labeled by their ICD-10 codes and descriptions. They enter the following additional information about the diagnosis: the date of the office visit, HCP who diagnosed patient, and any notes. They press the Save Diagnosis button .
3 4 [e] system A message shows if the diagnosis was documented correctly.
4 5 [c] A success message is displayed and the HCP sees the saved information.
